ompson and holds a cash edge, though outside groups have spent against him. Most expert raters call the race Likely Republican, with a few at Lean Republican.\n\nStill, the race has drawn unusual attention. Polls from late summer showed a near-tied contest, headlines have focused on carpetbagger allegations and questions about Flippo's military record, and national Democratic groups have backed Benitez-Thompson. Prediction markets give the Democrat roughly a three-in-ten chance. The combination of district lean and incumbent-party history keeps the Republican favored, but the margin is narrower than a typical cycle in this seat.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.213, "margin": -4.52}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2977, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2868, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2952, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2127, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2908, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.3379, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.3508, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.3896, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.3448, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.3118, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2576, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2807, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.1915, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2968, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.3004, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2172, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.2027, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.2837, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.2377, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.2769, "margin": -4.0}]}